      "writtenOn": "2025-06-11T17:08:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Youre right. I wrongly assumed, on_each_cpu() works serially. Looks like it calls smp_call_function_many_cond and runs in parallel. I wanted to avoid calling this two times in pkvm_init_finalise() - one if local cpu fails and one for rest of the cpus failure. But yes, this is a mistake. Will fix it",
