      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I wrongly assumed, on_each_cpu() works serially. Looks like it calls smp_call_function_many_cond and runs in parallel.\n\nDoes it matter? My point was that we end up executing pkvm_host_reprivilege_cpu() N^2 times (N times on each CPU), which is definitely not what we want.\n\n\u003e I wanted to avoid calling this two times in pkvm_init_finalise() - one if local cpu fails and one for rest of the cpus failure.\n\nWe can use a single goto for both, for example?",
